                <mxCell id="mold" value="moldudp64_parser.sv&#xa;&#xa;• Strips 20-byte MoldUDP64 header&#xa;  Session ID [0-9]&#xa;  SeqNum [10-17] (big-endian u64)&#xa;  MsgCount [18-19]&#xa;• 2-byte length prefix per block&#xa;• Gap detection: pkt_seq ≠ expected" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fce5e6;strokeColor=#6A1221;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" parent="sys_domain" vertex="1">
