                <mxCell id="ob" value="order_book.sv&#xa;&#xa;ORDER_SLOTS=256, NUM_LEVELS=8&#xa;&#xa;• Order ref table (valid/side/price/shares)&#xa;• 8 price levels/side&#xa;• BBO registers&#xa;• Serialised FSM:&#xa;  IDLE→ADD|DEL|REP_DEL→REP_ADD|EXE|CAN&#xa;• Priority: add&gt;del&gt;rep&gt;exe&gt;can&#xa;• recompute_bbo() each state end" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;" parent="sys_domain" vertex="1">
